## Product Search Feature Implementation

Adding intelligent product search with auto-completion to the comparator page.

### Implementation Checklist:

- [x] Create ProductSearch component with debounced search
- [x] Add ProductsController backend with search endpoint
- [x] Add /api/products/search route to backend
- [x] Integrate ProductSearch component into Comparateur page
- [x] Improve component cleanup and UX (clear search on select)
- [ ] Test search functionality with Open Food Facts API
- [ ] Verify responsive design and accessibility
- [ ] Run security review with CodeQL

### Changes Made:
✅ Created `ProductSearch.jsx` component with:
  - 250ms debounce for efficient API calls
  - Real-time search as user types (minimum 3 characters)
  - Display of product suggestions with name, brand, and image
  - Click to auto-fill EAN code and clear search
  - Proper useEffect cleanup for timer

✅ Created `ProductsController.ts` backend controller:
  - Search endpoint that queries Open Food Facts API
  - Returns up to 15 product results
  - Improved error handling with single try-catch

✅ Updated backend routes (`api.ts`):
  - Added `/api/products/search` route
  - Integrated ProductsController in Express routes

✅ Updated `Comparateur.jsx` page:
  - Added ProductSearch component above EAN input
  - Implemented `handlePickEAN` to auto-fill selected product

### Features:
- Text search for products (e.g., "riz basmati", "lait")
- 250ms debounce for performance
- Display product name, brand, and image in suggestions
- Click to auto-fill EAN code and clear search
- Integration with existing price comparator
- Responsive and accessible design

